{"articleNo":"509247","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=509247&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2025년 (재)달서인재육성장학재단 진학장학생 선발 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.03.20","hit":"8975","attachments":[{"name":"2025년 진학장학생 선발계획 공고.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=509247&attachNo=142004"},{"name":"신청서식 1부.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=509247&attachNo=142005"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">▣ (재)달서인재육성장학재단에서 2025년 진학장학생을 선발하오니 많은 신청 바랍니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">선발인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 30</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">내신우수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">15, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">수능우수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">15)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">신청자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">붙임 공고문 참조</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">접수기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2025. 4. 1.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)~4. 17.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">까지</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">접 수 처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)42731 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">대구광역시 달서구 학산로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">45(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월성동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -81.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">달서인재육성장학재단 사무국</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">달서구청 별관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">층 평생교육과 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">內</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">접수방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">방문 및 우편접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">마감일 우체국 소인까지 유효</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">방문접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">대리인 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">): </span><span style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">평일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">09~12</span><span style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, 13~18</span><span style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">/ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -13.1pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">공휴일 제외</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"10774\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 1,\n\"dv\": 0,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.1\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"11, 0, 0, 8778\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_10\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2025-03-20T17:01:44.344Z\",\n\"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\